WEBVTT

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:01.380
while China dominates processing.

00:05:02.173 --> 00:05:07.136
For cobalt, the Democratic Republic
of Congo dominates extraction

00:05:07.178 --> 00:05:10.014
while China dominates processing.

00:05:11.223 --> 00:05:12.933
For nickel,

00:05:12.975 --> 00:05:16.729
countries like Indonesia
and the Philippines

00:05:16.771 --> 00:05:18.147
tend to dominate extraction,

00:05:18.147 --> 00:05:21.859
while China, you guessed it, thank you,

00:05:21.859 --> 00:05:23.778
dominates processing.

00:05:24.362 --> 00:05:26.030
And for rare earths,

00:05:26.072 --> 00:05:29.992
China dominates extraction
while China dominates processing.